#. comic391 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic391.htm:34
msgctxt "comic391#title.1"
msgid "\"THE POWER IS YOURS\""
msgstr ""

#. comic391 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: console1.gif, ampstand2.gif, schamber.gif
#: kidradd/comic391.htm:75
msgctxt "comic391#p1.1"
msgid "Well, it appears that you can flip between your NPC and hero sprite forms at will."
msgstr ""

#. comic391 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: console1.gif, ampstand2.gif, schamber.gif
#: kidradd/comic391.htm:79
msgctxt "comic391#p1.2"
msgid "Thanks, but I already figured that out."
msgstr ""

#. comic391 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: ampstand.gif, sheenastand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic391.htm:130
msgctxt "comic391#p2.1"
msgid "It also appears that you earn your ultimate move every 500 shots, which clears the screen of enemies."
msgstr ""

#. comic391 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: ampstand.gif, sheenastand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic391.htm:134
msgctxt "comic391#p2.2"
msgid "Uh, the \"screen?\""
msgstr ""

#. comic391 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: amptable.gif
#: kidradd/comic391.htm:185
msgctxt "comic391#p3.1"
msgid "Yeah, it's kinda indefinite outside of a game. Plus it's inconsistent - it'll usually work on minor enemy sprites, but rarely on heroes, and almost never on bosses."
msgstr ""

#. comic391 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenawalk2.gif, ampstand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic391.htm:233
msgctxt "comic391#p4.1"
msgid "In other words, it only works when I don't need it."
msgstr ""

#. comic391 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenawalk2.gif, ampstand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic391.htm:237
msgctxt "comic391#p4.2"
msgid "Pretty much. But it's still better than those RPG \"Death\" spells."
msgstr ""

#. comic392 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic392.htm:52
msgctxt "comic392#title.1"
msgid "\"CAN'T FIGHT THIS FEELING\""
msgstr ""

#. comic392 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: thought2.gif, sheenawalk2.gif
#: kidradd/comic392.htm:93
msgctxt "comic392#p1.1"
msgid "So much effort, so little progress. Seems like we're never gonna get together enough allies to challenge Crystal. What are we doing wrong?"
msgstr ""

#. comic392 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sscream.gif
#: kidradd/comic392.htm:252
msgctxt "comic392#p4.1"
msgid "AIIIEEE!!!"
msgstr ""

#. comic392 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: sscream.gif
#: kidradd/comic392.htm:254
msgctxt "comic392#p4.2"
msgid "Sis?"
msgstr ""

#. comic392 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sscream.gif
#: kidradd/comic392.htm:256
msgctxt "comic392#p4.3"
msgid "I don't know what's going on, but I like it!"
msgstr ""

#. comic393 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic393.htm:34
msgctxt "comic393#title.1"
msgid "\"CRUSH\""
msgstr ""

#. comic393 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenamad.gif
#: kidradd/comic393.htm:75
msgctxt "comic393#p1.1"
msgid "<b>You!</b> Quit messing with my head!"
msgstr ""

#. comic393 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenamad.gif
#: kidradd/comic393.htm:79
msgctxt "comic393#p1.2"
msgid "Oh, relax. It was only a hug."
msgstr ""

#. comic393 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenafume.gif
#: kidradd/comic393.htm:130
msgctxt "comic393#p2.1"
msgid "But that was... Bogey!"
msgstr ""

#. comic393 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenafume.gif
#: kidradd/comic393.htm:134
msgctxt "comic393#p2.2"
msgid "I know! Isn't he just the cutest little thing?"
msgstr ""

#. comic393 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: swha2.gif
#: kidradd/comic393.htm:181
msgctxt "comic393#p3.1"
msgid "You mean \"cute\" as in huggable plushy toy, not \"cute\" as in, \"I wanna marry him,\" right?"
msgstr ""

#. comic393 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: swha2.gif
#: kidradd/comic393.htm:185
msgctxt "comic393#p3.2"
msgid "I dunno. What's the difference?"
msgstr ""

#. comic393 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: headbang.gif
#: kidradd/comic393.htm:233
msgctxt "comic393#p4.1"
msgid "You know, that would hurt more if you weren't in NPC mode."
msgstr ""

#. comic393 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: headbang.gif
#: kidradd/comic393.htm:237
msgctxt "comic393#p4.2"
msgid "Shut up! My subconscious does not need a narrator."
msgstr ""

#. comic394 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic394.htm:34
msgctxt "comic394#title.1"
msgid "\"COLLISION COURSE\""
msgstr ""

#. comic394 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: ship4.gif
#: kidradd/comic394.htm:90
msgctxt "comic394#p1.1"
msgid "Okay guys, I think this server will be a good candidate for finding recruits."
msgstr ""

#. comic394 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: ship4.gif
#: kidradd/comic394.htm:94
msgctxt "comic394#p1.2"
msgid "Why? Is there a sprite colony here?"
msgstr ""

#. comic394 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: ship.gif, shshadow.gif
#: kidradd/comic394.htm:144
msgctxt "comic394#p2.1"
msgid "Negative. But..."
msgstr ""

#. comic394 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: ship.gif, shshadow.gif
#: kidradd/comic394.htm:148
msgctxt "comic394#p2.2"
msgid "Whoa. That's a lotta games."
msgstr ""

#. comic394 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: sheenastand.gif, ampstand2.gif, bogeystand2.gif, raddright.gif
#: kidradd/comic394.htm:196
msgctxt "comic394#p3.1"
msgid "Yeah, humans download a lot from this place. Seems pretty popular."
msgstr ""

#. comic394 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenastand.gif, ampstand2.gif, bogeystand2.gif, raddright.gif
#: kidradd/comic394.htm:198
msgctxt "comic394#p3.2"
msgid "Maybe, but you've gotta be wrong about it being uninhabited."
msgstr ""

#. comic394 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: uhoh.gif
#: kidradd/comic394.htm:247
msgctxt "comic394#p4.1"
msgid "Hm?"
msgstr ""

#. comic394 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: uhoh.gif
#: kidradd/comic394.htm:249
msgctxt "comic394#p4.2"
msgid "I mean, that ship charging toward us at breakneck speed is being driven by <i>someone.</i>"
msgstr ""

#. comic394 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: uhoh.gif
#: kidradd/comic394.htm:251
msgctxt "comic394#p4.3"
msgid "Gyahh!!!"
msgstr ""

#. comic394 panel p4
#. slot: insert ground "tiles" on this line
#. images: uhoh.gif
#: kidradd/comic394.htm:260
msgctxt "comic394#p4.4"
msgid "I must really, really hate epileptics."
msgstr ""

#. comic395 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic395.htm:46
msgctxt "comic395#title.1"
msgid "\"CRASH INTO ME\""
msgstr ""

#. comic395 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: gfollow.gif
#: kidradd/comic395.htm:87
msgctxt "comic395#p1.1"
msgid "It's like it was waiting for us..."
msgstr ""

#. comic395 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: gfollow.gif
#: kidradd/comic395.htm:89
msgctxt "comic395#p1.2"
msgid "Is it firing?"
msgstr ""

#. comic395 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: gfollow.gif
#: kidradd/comic395.htm:91
msgctxt "comic395#p1.3"
msgid "No, but..."
msgstr ""

#. comic395 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#: kidradd/comic395.htm:143
msgctxt "comic395#p2.1"
msgid "What the heck is it doing?"
msgstr ""

#. comic395 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic395.htm:145
msgctxt "comic395#p2.2"
msgid "Evasive maneuvers!"
msgstr ""

#. comic395 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#: kidradd/comic395.htm:147
msgctxt "comic395#p2.3"
msgid "Too late!"
msgstr ""

#. comic395 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: gship.gif, shshadow.gif
#: kidradd/comic395.htm:194
msgctxt "comic395#p3.1"
msgid "Uh, this is... different."
msgstr ""

#. comic395 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: gship.gif, shshadow.gif
#: kidradd/comic395.htm:196
msgctxt "comic395#p3.2"
msgid "It embedded itself in our hull?"
msgstr ""

#. comic395 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: gship.gif, shshadow.gif
#: kidradd/comic395.htm:198
msgctxt "comic395#p3.3"
msgid "Crap. He's probably boarding us right now! Be prepared!"
msgstr ""

#. comic395 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: gnarlblink.gif, grouphuh.gif
#: kidradd/comic395.htm:245
msgctxt "comic395#p4.1"
msgid "Hi guys! Whassup?"
msgstr ""

#. comic395 panel p5
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: groupnah.gif
#: kidradd/comic395.htm:298
msgctxt "comic395#p5.1"
msgid "Just my stupid brother. Man, that's anticlimactic."
msgstr ""

#. comic395 panel p5
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: groupnah.gif
#: kidradd/comic395.htm:302
msgctxt "comic395#p5.2"
msgid "Jerks. No one appreciates a good entrance anymore..."
msgstr ""

#. comic396 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic396.htm:34
msgctxt "comic396#title.1"
msgid "\"DON'T EXPECT THE DEPOSIT BACK\""
msgstr ""

#. comic396 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: gship.gif, shshadow.gif
#: kidradd/comic396.htm:75
msgctxt "comic396#p1.1"
msgid "How the heck did you find us?"
msgstr ""

#. comic396 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: gship.gif, shshadow.gif
#: kidradd/comic396.htm:79
msgctxt "comic396#p1.2"
msgid "I heard you guys were in the area and just knew you'd wanna check this server out. Cool, ain't it?"
msgstr ""

#. comic396 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: sheenastand.gif, bogeystand.gif, raddstand.gif, gnarlblink2.gif
#: kidradd/comic396.htm:131
msgctxt "comic396#p2.1"
msgid "But where'd you get the ship?"
msgstr ""

#. comic396 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenastand.gif, bogeystand.gif, raddstand.gif, gnarlblink2.gif
#: kidradd/comic396.htm:133
msgctxt "comic396#p2.2"
msgid "Oh, it's a loaner from Crystal. Well, <i>was</i> anyway."
msgstr ""

#. comic396 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: sheenano.gif, bogeyyell.gif, raddwow.gif, gnarlblink2.gif
#: kidradd/comic396.htm:182
msgctxt "comic396#p3.1"
msgid "You're working for Crystal???"
msgstr ""

#. comic396 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenano.gif, bogeyyell.gif, raddwow.gif, gnarlblink2.gif
#: kidradd/comic396.htm:184
msgctxt "comic396#p3.2"
msgid "Sorta. Well, not really. It's a funny story."
msgstr ""

#. comic396 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: sheenamad.gif, bogeymad.gif, charge.gif, gnarledge2.gif
#: kidradd/comic396.htm:234
msgctxt "comic396#p4.1"
msgid "We all could use a good laugh. Talk."
msgstr ""

#. comic396 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenamad.gif, bogeymad.gif, charge.gif, gnarledge2.gif
#: kidradd/comic396.htm:236
msgctxt "comic396#p4.2"
msgid "Boy, you guys sure are uptight. I'd think you'd get along with Crystal better."
msgstr ""

#. comic397 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic397.htm:46
msgctxt "comic397#title.1"
msgid "\"STORMY WEATHER\""
msgstr ""

#. comic397 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: gship.gif, shshadow.gif
#: kidradd/comic397.htm:87
msgctxt "comic397#p1.1"
msgid "So you used Crystal just to get a ship? That's insane!"
msgstr ""

#. comic397 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: gship.gif, shshadow.gif
#: kidradd/comic397.htm:91
msgctxt "comic397#p1.2"
msgid "Well, I was kinda low on resources."
msgstr ""

#. comic397 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenaright.gif, raddargh.gif, gnarlblink2.gif
#: kidradd/comic397.htm:141
msgctxt "comic397#p2.1"
msgid "But what on earth made you so desperate to find us?"
msgstr ""

#. comic397 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenaright.gif, raddargh.gif, gnarlblink2.gif
#: kidradd/comic397.htm:145
msgctxt "comic397#p2.2"
msgid "C'mon Radd, you know the answer to that..."
msgstr ""

#. comic397 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: gheadjoy.gif
#: kidradd/comic397.htm:194
msgctxt "comic397#p3.1"
msgid "I'm here in the interest of securing our mutual happiness."
msgstr ""

#. comic397 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic397.htm:247
msgctxt "comic397#p4.1"
msgid "Non-subtle depiction of emotion. Like, no duh."
msgstr ""

#. comic397 panel p5
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: brood.gif
#: kidradd/comic397.htm:299
msgctxt "comic397#p5.1"
msgid "Guys, Gnarl and I have to talk in private."
msgstr ""

#. comic397 panel p5
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: brood.gif
#: kidradd/comic397.htm:303
msgctxt "comic397#p5.2"
msgid "Yikes. Did the temperature just drop in here?..."
msgstr ""

#. comic398 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic398.htm:46
msgctxt "comic398#title.1"
msgid "\"UNACCEPTABLE\""
msgstr ""

#. comic398 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenatback.gif, gnarlback2.gif, raddback2.gif
#: kidradd/comic398.htm:87
msgctxt "comic398#p1.1"
msgid "Where're you going?"
msgstr ""

#. comic398 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenatback.gif, gnarlback2.gif, raddback2.gif
#: kidradd/comic398.htm:91
msgctxt "comic398#p1.2"
msgid "Off the ship for a while. We need to be alone."
msgstr ""

#. comic398 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenaright.gif, raddmood.gif, gnarlblink2.gif
#: kidradd/comic398.htm:140
msgctxt "comic398#p2.1"
msgid "You can talk privately somewhere inside! Why leave?"
msgstr ""

#. comic398 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenaright.gif, raddmood.gif, gnarlblink2.gif
#: kidradd/comic398.htm:144
msgctxt "comic398#p2.2"
msgid "Well, we need to talk where there's lotsa open space and no innocent bystanders."
msgstr ""

#. comic398 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic398.htm:193
msgctxt "comic398#p3.1"
msgid "Oh no... No, no, no <b>no NO!!!</b><br>Hell no, I won't allow this!"
msgstr ""

#. comic398 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenaaim.gif, raddscare2.gif, gnarlhey2.gif
#: kidradd/comic398.htm:244
msgctxt "comic398#p4.1"
msgid "I am <b>not</b> letting you guys kill each other, even if I hafta shoot you myself!"
msgstr ""

#. comic398 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: sheenaaim.gif, raddscare2.gif, gnarlhey2.gif
#: kidradd/comic398.htm:246
msgctxt "comic398#p4.2"
msgid "Sh-Sheena!..."
msgstr ""

#. comic398 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenaaim.gif, raddscare2.gif, gnarlhey2.gif
#: kidradd/comic398.htm:248
msgctxt "comic398#p4.3"
msgid "Whoa. I dig the new duds."
msgstr ""

#. comic399 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic399.htm:35
msgctxt "comic399#title.1"
msgid "\"STRONG WORDS\""
msgstr ""

#. comic399 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: gnarlstand.gif, raddblink.gif, msheenaback2.gif
#: kidradd/comic399.htm:76
msgctxt "comic399#p1.1"
msgid "Sheena, don't worry about it. I'll be okay."
msgstr ""

#. comic399 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: gnarlstand.gif, raddblink.gif, msheenaback2.gif
#: kidradd/comic399.htm:80
msgctxt "comic399#p1.2"
msgid "You... You self-centered jerk..."
msgstr ""

#. comic399 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: stupid.gif
#: kidradd/comic399.htm:129
msgctxt "comic399#p2.1"
msgid "I don't want <i>either</i> of you to die! You're both my friends; heck, I've known Gnarl longer than you."
msgstr ""

#. comic399 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: stupid.gif
#: kidradd/comic399.htm:133
msgctxt "comic399#p2.2"
msgid "Oh, right. Well, trust me anyway. I happen to know for a fact that everything will be alright."
msgstr ""

#. comic399 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: msheenafume.gif, gnarlblink.gif, raddright.gif
#: kidradd/comic399.htm:178
msgctxt "comic399#p3.1"
msgid "But... this is freakin' <b>NUTS!!!</b>"
msgstr ""

#. comic399 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: msheenafume.gif, gnarlblink.gif, raddright.gif
#: kidradd/comic399.htm:182
msgctxt "comic399#p3.2"
msgid "It looks that way, but it'll be fine. See ya soon."
msgstr ""

#. comic399 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: farewell.gif
#: kidradd/comic399.htm:230
msgctxt "comic399#p4.1"
msgid "<i>Sniff...</i> Idiot... I'll never understand him..."
msgstr ""

#. comic399 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: farewell.gif
#: kidradd/comic399.htm:234
msgctxt "comic399#p4.2"
msgid "Yeah, sad. So where's the green guy?"
msgstr ""

#. comic400 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic400.htm:52
msgctxt "comic400#title.1"
msgid "\"DESTINY?\""
msgstr ""

#. comic400 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddstand2.gif, gnarlstand.gif
#: kidradd/comic400.htm:93
msgctxt "comic400#p1.1"
msgid "Well Gnarl, you're getting what you wanted."
msgstr ""

#. comic400 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddstand2.gif, gnarlstand.gif
#: kidradd/comic400.htm:97
msgctxt "comic400#p1.2"
msgid "Thank you Radd, I hope this means as much to you as it does to me."
msgstr ""

#. comic400 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#: kidradd/comic400.htm:148
msgctxt "comic400#p2.1"
msgid "Not really. But hopefully soon you'll understand why."
msgstr ""

#. comic400 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#: kidradd/comic400.htm:152
msgctxt "comic400#p2.2"
msgid "What's to understand?"
msgstr ""

#. comic400 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic400.htm:201
msgctxt "comic400#p3.1"
msgid "We two were created for the purpose of fighting each other. Unless we follow our purpose, we can never be truly happy."
msgstr ""

#. comic400 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#: kidradd/comic400.htm:252
msgctxt "comic400#p4.1"
msgid "That, Gnarl, is where you're wrong."
msgstr ""

#. comic400 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#: kidradd/comic400.htm:256
msgctxt "comic400#p4.2"
msgid "Perhaps. But there's one way to find out!"
msgstr ""

#. comic401 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic401.htm:52
msgctxt "comic401#title.1"
msgid "\"BLURRY\""
msgstr ""

#. comic401 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: grunc.gif
#: kidradd/comic401.htm:95
msgctxt "comic401#p1.1"
msgid "Let me tell you a little story, Radd. It begins where our old game ended..."
msgstr ""

#. comic401 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: fgblocks.gif
#: kidradd/comic401.htm:148
msgctxt "comic401#p2.1"
msgid "When I was set \"free\" into the cyberworld, it was unnerving. I didn't know what to do with myself."
msgstr ""

#. comic401 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic401.htm:197
msgctxt "comic401#p3.1"
msgid "Sure, I followed the same routine as everyone else, got a job, and tried to be \"civilized.\" But it all seemed so... pointless."
msgstr ""

#. comic401 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic401.htm:250
msgctxt "comic401#p4.1"
msgid "I knew that this world was just as fake as the game I came from, and that it wasn't what I was made for. I could no longer live the lie."
msgstr ""

#. comic402 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic402.htm:52
msgctxt "comic402#title.1"
msgid "\"CRISIS? WHAT CRISIS?\""
msgstr ""

#. comic402 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: gstrafe.gif
#: kidradd/comic402.htm:95
msgctxt "comic402#p1.1"
msgid "I realized the truth: Computer programs are at their happiest when they're following their programming."
msgstr ""

#. comic402 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic402.htm:149
msgctxt "comic402#p2.1"
msgid "Thus, video game characters like ourselves can only be truly happy when we do what we were made to do. It's that simple."
msgstr ""

#. comic402 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic402.htm:201
msgctxt "comic402#p3.1"
msgid "Even if it means that one of us dies, I <i>have</i> to try to kill you, or else be unfulfilled. You understand that, don't you?"
msgstr ""

#. comic402 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: shadows.gif
#: kidradd/comic402.htm:253
msgctxt "comic402#p4.1"
msgid "Sigh... As much as I'd like to say no, Gnarl, I think I do understand..."
msgstr ""

#. comic403 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic403.htm:48
msgctxt "comic403#title.1"
msgid "\"GIVE IN\""
msgstr ""

#. comic403 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: tiny.gif
#: kidradd/comic403.htm:91
msgctxt "comic403#p1.1"
msgid "...Because I'm a player character, a \"hero.\" My programming is different from yours, but I too have felt the desire to follow it."
msgstr ""

#. comic403 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: rheadsad.gif
#: kidradd/comic403.htm:147
msgctxt "comic403#p2.1"
msgid "I'm meant to be an empty shell, just a puppet for a human player to control. In the game, if a human didn't touch the controller, I'd stand in one place all day, never doing anything on my own."
msgstr ""

#. comic403 panel p3
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#. images: tv.gif, raddsit2.gif, bogeyyell2.gif
#: kidradd/comic403.htm:194
msgctxt "comic403#p3.1"
msgid "\"And unsurprisingly, that's pretty much what I continued to do when I left the game. I lacked ambition, and didn't know what to do without a human taking the wheel. Like you, I just did... what I do. Nothing.\""
msgstr ""

#. comic403 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: fgbg.gif
#: kidradd/comic403.htm:257
msgctxt "comic403#p4.1"
msgid "But unlike you, I've grown since then; I've developed my own desires. I'm not a mere slave to my programming; my goals are <i>truly</i> my own. Can you understand that?"
msgstr ""

#. comic403 panel p5
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: fgbg2.gif
#: kidradd/comic403.htm:308
msgctxt "comic403#p5.1"
msgid "No, Radd. And I don't <i>want</i> to, because this fight is all there is to me."
msgstr ""

#. comic403 panel p6
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic403.htm:361
msgctxt "comic403#p6.1"
msgid "This is my moment of supreme happiness, and I will never abandon it for anything else!"
msgstr ""

#. comic404 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic404.htm:48
msgctxt "comic404#title.1"
msgid "\"OVER AND OVER\""
msgstr ""

#. comic404 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: runtable.gif
#: kidradd/comic404.htm:91
msgctxt "comic404#p1.1"
msgid "Oh, for crying out loud... This is ridiculous!"
msgstr ""

#. comic404 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: gcircle.gif
#: kidradd/comic404.htm:146
msgctxt "comic404#p2.1"
msgid "You realize you're using the same basic patterns you used in the video game? Running in circles and firing?"
msgstr ""

#. comic404 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: grunc2.gif
#: kidradd/comic404.htm:199
msgctxt "comic404#p3.1"
msgid "Well of course! I'm living out my programming, and it's the greatest joy I know!"
msgstr ""

#. comic404 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic404.htm:250
msgctxt "comic404#p4.1"
msgid "Idiot. I guess it's time to put an end to this farce."
msgstr ""

#. comic405 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic405.htm:48
msgctxt "comic405#title.1"
msgid "\"RIDE THE LIGHTNING\""
msgstr ""

#. comic405 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: calmcharge.gif, gnarlblink2.gif
#: kidradd/comic405.htm:92
msgctxt "comic405#p1.1"
msgid "Charging up, eh? Cool. While you're not firing, I'll go ballistic on ya!"
msgstr ""

#. comic405 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: blurdodge.gif
#: kidradd/comic405.htm:148
msgctxt "comic405#p2.1"
msgid "Hey! What the?..."
msgstr ""

#. comic405 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: blurdodge.gif
#: kidradd/comic405.htm:152
msgctxt "comic405#p2.2"
msgid "You can't hit me, Gnarl. Even if you weren't using the same stupid firing patterns, I've improved a lot since the old days. ...Unlike you."
msgstr ""

#. comic405 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: gnarlbad.gif
#: kidradd/comic405.htm:199
msgctxt "comic405#p3.1"
msgid "Gah!!!! Impossible!"
msgstr ""

#. comic405 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: gnarlbad.gif
#: kidradd/comic405.htm:203
msgctxt "comic405#p3.2"
msgid "Nah, easy."
msgstr ""

#. comic405 panel p3
#. slot: insert ground "tiles" on this line
#. images: gnarlbad.gif
#: kidradd/comic405.htm:212
msgctxt "comic405#p3.3"
msgid "Just a bit exaggerated."
msgstr ""

#. comic405 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: ohno.gif
#: kidradd/comic405.htm:252
msgctxt "comic405#p4.1"
msgid "You... You were <b>holding back???</b>"
msgstr ""

#. comic405 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: ohno.gif
#: kidradd/comic405.htm:256
msgctxt "comic405#p4.2"
msgid "Big time. If I recall correctly, you have 1,000 HP, right?"
msgstr ""

#. comic405 panel p5
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic405.htm:309
msgctxt "comic405#p5.1"
msgid "So I should be powered up enough right... about... <b>NOW!</b>"
msgstr ""

#. comic406 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic406.htm:48
msgctxt "comic406#title.1"
msgid "\"FEEL THE BURN\""
msgstr ""

#. comic406 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#: kidradd/comic406.htm:89
msgctxt "comic406#p1.1"
msgid "Owwwwch... What was <b>that?</b>"
msgstr ""

#. comic406 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#: kidradd/comic406.htm:93
msgctxt "comic406#p1.2"
msgid "999 points of hurt, leaving ya with just 1 hit left."
msgstr ""

#. comic406 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: butwhy.gif
#: kidradd/comic406.htm:145
msgctxt "comic406#p2.1"
msgid "But, how did you... no, <b>why</b> did you do that?"
msgstr ""

#. comic406 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: butwhy.gif
#: kidradd/comic406.htm:149
msgctxt "comic406#p2.2"
msgid "To show that you can't possibly beat me. Heck, I'm not even using my full arsenal, check this:"
msgstr ""

#. comic406 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: yafly.gif
#: kidradd/comic406.htm:198
msgctxt "comic406#p3.1"
msgid "You can <b>fly</b> now?"
msgstr ""

#. comic406 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: yafly.gif
#: kidradd/comic406.htm:202
msgctxt "comic406#p3.2"
msgid "Yep. But I don't need that trick to battle circles around you. I way outclass you."
msgstr ""

#. comic406 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sothere1.gif
#: kidradd/comic406.htm:252
msgctxt "comic406#p4.1"
msgid "Yeah, but don't forget: <b>I</b> can transform into the Gnarlborg!"
msgstr ""

#. comic406 panel p6
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sothere3.gif
#: kidradd/comic406.htm:357
msgctxt "comic406#p6.1"
msgid "Well, I can..."
msgstr ""

#. comic406 panel p6
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sothere3.gif
#: kidradd/comic406.htm:361
msgctxt "comic406#p6.2"
msgid "Does it ever help?"
msgstr ""

#. comic407 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic407.htm:48
msgctxt "comic407#title.1"
msgid "\"BRING ON THE PAIN\""
msgstr ""

#. comic407 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddright.gif, gnarlfist2.gif
#: kidradd/comic407.htm:90
msgctxt "comic407#p1.1"
msgid "Face it Gnarl, you can't defeat me. Period."
msgstr ""

#. comic407 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddright.gif, gnarlfist2.gif
#: kidradd/comic407.htm:94
msgctxt "comic407#p1.2"
msgid "Perhaps, but I don't go down without a fight!"
msgstr ""

#. comic407 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: banzai.gif
#: kidradd/comic407.htm:149
msgctxt "comic407#p2.1"
msgid "I'll never give up!!!"
msgstr ""

#. comic407 panel p2
#. slot: insert ground "tiles" on this line
#. images: banzai.gif
#: kidradd/comic407.htm:160
msgctxt "comic407#p2.2"
msgid "Well, he's supposed to be attacking."
msgstr ""

#. comic407 panel p3
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#. images: gnarlpant.gif, raddblink2.gif
#: kidradd/comic407.htm:196
msgctxt "comic407#p3.1"
msgid "Five minutes later..."
msgstr ""

#. comic407 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: gnarlpant.gif, raddblink2.gif
#: kidradd/comic407.htm:202
msgctxt "comic407#p3.2"
msgid "I give up! Just kill me already!"
msgstr ""

#. comic407 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: gnarlpant.gif, raddblink2.gif
#: kidradd/comic407.htm:206
msgctxt "comic407#p3.3"
msgid "Kill you? Dear brother, that would be too easy..."
msgstr ""

#. comic407 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic407.htm:259
msgctxt "comic407#p4.1"
msgid "...You're going to suffer!"
msgstr ""

#. comic408 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic408.htm:46
msgctxt "comic408#title.1"
msgid "\"THAT'S JUST THE WAY IT IS\""
msgstr ""

#. comic408 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: tiny.gif
#: kidradd/comic408.htm:87
msgctxt "comic408#p1.1"
msgid "Sorry Gnarl, but you're gonna hafta deal with the struggle of living just like the rest of us."
msgstr ""

#. comic408 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: tiny.gif
#: kidradd/comic408.htm:91
msgctxt "comic408#p1.2"
msgid "But..."
msgstr ""

#. comic408 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: rheadmad2.gif
#: kidradd/comic408.htm:145
msgctxt "comic408#p2.1"
msgid "I'm no longer a puppet to my programming, or to a human. I don't just mimic my former player's goals and moves, but have developed new ones on my own."
msgstr ""

#. comic408 panel p3
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#: kidradd/comic408.htm:192
msgctxt "comic408#p3.1"
msgid "\"You, on the other hand, have stayed the same as you always were, changing none, improving none. You've learned nothing.\""
msgstr ""

#. comic408 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: butwhy2.gif
#: kidradd/comic408.htm:251
msgctxt "comic408#p4.1"
msgid "Which is why you can't beat me. I'll continue to change, and you'll stay the same. The difference between us will forever grow."
msgstr ""

#. comic408 panel p5
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: fgbg3.gif
#: kidradd/comic408.htm:306
msgctxt "comic408#p5.1"
msgid "You'll never be able to have a \"real\" battle with me, and I'll never kill you. Your programming will forever go unfulfilled."
msgstr ""

#. comic408 panel p6
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: stormy3.gif
#: kidradd/comic408.htm:357
msgctxt "comic408#p6.1"
msgid "You can't do that to me! It's... it's too cruel..."
msgstr ""

#. comic408 panel p6
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: stormy3.gif
#: kidradd/comic408.htm:361
msgctxt "comic408#p6.2"
msgid "It has to be. It's the only way you'll learn."
msgstr ""

#. comic409 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic409.htm:58
msgctxt "comic409#title.1"
msgid "\"WHAT HAVE WE LEARNED?\""
msgstr ""

#. comic409 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: fgbg4.gif
#: kidradd/comic409.htm:99
msgctxt "comic409#p1.1"
msgid "You monster!!! You've killed any chance I ever had of ever being happy!"
msgstr ""

#. comic409 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: fgbg4.gif
#: kidradd/comic409.htm:103
msgctxt "comic409#p1.2"
msgid "Moron. I'm doing this because I care about you."
msgstr ""

#. comic409 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: speech1.gif
#: kidradd/comic409.htm:156
msgctxt "comic409#p2.1"
msgid "You'll learn soon enough that blindly following your pre-programmed desires isn't true happiness. Sure, it's fun once in a while, but it isn't everything."
msgstr ""

#. comic409 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic409.htm:207
msgctxt "comic409#p3.1"
msgid "You are more than just your programming. We all are. And it'd be a terrible waste if you never even tried to expand yourself."
msgstr ""

#. comic409 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#: kidradd/comic409.htm:258
msgctxt "comic409#p4.1"
msgid "So get out there and forge a life on your own. It won't be long before you discover things that make you far happier than stupid set patterns."
msgstr ""

#. comic409 panel p5
#. slot: left bubble
#: kidradd/comic409.htm:309
msgctxt "comic409#p5.1"
msgid "Later, Gnarl. Good luck on the path ahead, whatever you make it to be."
msgstr ""

#. comic409 panel p5
#. slot: right bubble
#: kidradd/comic409.htm:313
msgctxt "comic409#p5.2"
msgid "It can't be true..."
msgstr ""

#. comic410 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic410.htm:34
msgctxt "comic410#title.1"
msgid "\"YOU'RE GONNA CARRY THAT WEIGHT\""
msgstr ""

#. comic410 panel p1
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#. images: gbrood.gif
#: kidradd/comic410.htm:71
msgctxt "comic410#p1.1"
msgid "\"So, any change?\""
msgstr ""

#. comic410 panel p1
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#. images: gbrood.gif
#: kidradd/comic410.htm:72
msgctxt "comic410#p1.2"
msgid "\"Well, he's sat out there moping and acting depressed for the last couple of hours. But it looks like he's finally coming back.\""
msgstr ""

#. comic410 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: gnarlsad.gif, group2.gif
#: kidradd/comic410.htm:133
msgctxt "comic410#p2.1"
msgid "Guys, I'm sorry about all this. Really. I..."
msgstr ""

#. comic410 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: gnarlsad.gif, group2.gif
#: kidradd/comic410.htm:135
msgctxt "comic410#p2.2"
msgid "It's okay, dude."
msgstr ""

#. comic410 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: gnarlbtable.gif
#: kidradd/comic410.htm:189
msgctxt "comic410#p3.1"
msgid "I guess I thought that if life didn't have a simple, direct purpose it wasn't... I don't know. Maybe I couldn't face that the answers weren't that easy."
msgstr ""

#. comic410 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: gnarlright.gif, raddstare2.gif, sheenaleft.gif
#: kidradd/comic410.htm:238
msgctxt "comic410#p4.1"
msgid "So, uh, if you guys wouldn't mind helping me fix my ship, I guess I'll be going now."
msgstr ""

#. comic410 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: gnarlright.gif, raddstare2.gif, sheenaleft.gif
#: kidradd/comic410.htm:242
msgctxt "comic410#p4.2"
msgid "You don't have to leave us."
msgstr ""

#. comic410 panel p5
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: gnarlstable.gif
#: kidradd/comic410.htm:296
msgctxt "comic410#p5.1"
msgid "Yeah, I do. Hanging around with you guys might be too much like the ol' game, and I need to figure out who I am on my own before I can chill with you guys again. So... off I go. And... thanks."
msgstr ""

#. comic410 panel p6
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sunset.gif
#: kidradd/comic410.htm:343
msgctxt "comic410#p6.1"
msgid "Is he gonna be okay?"
msgstr ""

#. comic410 panel p6
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sunset.gif
#: kidradd/comic410.htm:347
msgctxt "comic410#p6.2"
msgid "Yeah, he will. I'm sure of it."
msgstr ""
